# Presentation DSL

The DSL is the shared contract for web and PPTX. It must not contain physical geometry.

Forbidden keys: `x`, `y`, `w`, `h`, `left`, `top`, `fontSize`, `coordinates`.

```ts
// BAD
{ archetype: "TR-01", x: 0.5, y: 0.3, fontSize: 22 }

// GOOD
{ archetype: "TR-01", actionTitle: "...", content: { current, transformation, target, takeaway } }
```

Validate with `validatePresentation` before layout. M0 implements only `TR-01`.
